# Reacting to messages: `r` opens the emoji picker, a few letters find one.

Output docs/media/reactions.gif
Source docs/tapes/common.tape

Type "slackterm demo"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Ctrl+K
Type "release"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show
Sleep 1s

# The Android build is out: celebrate it.
Type@500ms "kk"
Sleep 700ms
Type "r"
Sleep 1.6s
Type@150ms "tada"
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 1.6s

# Add our flame to the store visuals.
Type "k"
Sleep 700ms
Type "r"
Sleep 900ms
Type@150ms "fire"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2.2s
